{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>On the morrow of the Shabbat.</b> On the morrow of the first yom tov of Pesach. As Rabbi Elazar ben Rabbi Shimon said: one verse says ״שבעת ימים מצות תאכלו״ and one verse says ״ששת ימים תאכל מצת״. How so — how shall these two verses be fulfilled? Rather: at a time when you cannot [eat] all seven from the old grain, eat six from the new. So what do I fulfill by ״ממחרת השבת״? On the morrow of yom tov."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:32.669415109Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}